title: Items
---
// The player's items (see src/story/inventory.rs). He carries an item while its variable
// is true: give it with <<set $item_ID to true>>, take it with <<set $item_ID to false>>,
// check it with <<if $item_ID>>. Every item needs a row in ITEMS and a declaration here.
<<declare $item_blush_socks = false>>
<<declare $item_bakery_bag = false>>
<<declare $item_wine_fox = false>>
<<declare $item_wine_reserve = false>>
<<declare $item_wine_house = false>>
<<declare $item_tulips = false>>
<<declare $item_chocolates = false>>
<<declare $item_corkscrew = false>>
===
